to-be-incorporated-into-paper-166 : List Word
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-166 = unlines (cons "In hyperactivity's language as the repository implements it: The checker (`chk-codef` in `lib/check.cub`) requires every call of a mutual group of copattern definitions in a field's term to" (cons "be guarded: it is the head of the field's term (applied to arguments not mentioning the group, at" (cons "any dimensions), or stands there under a λ, a line, a pair, a constructor, a case or system" (cons "branch, or a let's body; never as an argument or eliminated. Every body of a group is found guarded" (cons "before any is checked, since checking one can unfold another. Each body is then checked at its" (cons "type, the group's calls at their declared types. A guarded call is productive, so the value exists at" (cons "every depth. At a path type the boundary is checked field by field (a record is compared with a" (cons "value by its fields), so it holds at every depth. Two stuck calls are convertible when their" (cons "definitions and arguments are; there is no η for codata, so two definitions whose unfoldings are" (cons "bisimilar are not convertible. Their equality is a path, and a path between two values of a" (cons "codata type is a bisimulation." nil)))))))))))
